1
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,509
♪The world keeps changing♪

2
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,979
♪A thousand years pass
in the blink of an eye♪

3
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,159
♪Shoulder to shoulder♪

4
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,399
♪We stand above the world♪

5
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,590
♪Our identities switch♪

6
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,320
♪The world turns upside down♪

7
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,729
♪Watch me♪

8
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:35,319
♪Stir up a storm♪

9
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,609
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

10
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,059
♪Our blood is boiling♪

11
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:45,289
♪The genius emperor plots
with brilliant strategy♪

12
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:49,709
♪The slacker general
is unmatched in battle♪

13
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,199
♪The business world is in turmoil♪

14
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,749
♪The court is rife with intrigue♪

15
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:59,169
♪We will conquer the world♪

16
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:03,510
♪There's no escape for the traitors♪

17
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:07,999
=No Way! My Bro is the Emperor=

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,160
=Episode 18=

19
00:01:17,580 --> 00:01:18,730
Greetings, Master.

20
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:26,129
Chancellor Hu,

21
00:01:26,130 --> 00:01:27,429
very well.

22
00:01:27,430 --> 00:01:28,570
You've done a good job.

23
00:01:29,490 --> 00:01:31,530
Now that Xiao Ce is gravely ill

24
00:01:31,650 --> 00:01:33,700
and Gu Bei remains unconscious.

25
00:01:34,050 --> 00:01:36,260
They're no longer a threat to us.

26
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:39,200
Take this opportunity
to move the Fushou Cream

27
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,539
out of the capital

28
00:01:40,540 --> 00:01:41,980
and distribute it nationwide.

29
00:01:42,290 --> 00:01:43,060
Yes, Master.

30
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:45,179
Yan Qiu has fulfilled her mission.

31
00:01:45,180 --> 00:01:46,609
Dispose of her

32
00:01:46,610 --> 00:01:48,140
and her brother as well.

33
00:01:48,180 --> 00:01:49,209
As you command,

34
00:01:49,210 --> 00:01:50,340
Master.

35
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,340
My plan

36
00:01:55,820 --> 00:01:57,290
is finally coming together.

37
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:01,250
What are you doing here?

38
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:02,200
You!

39
00:02:02,210 --> 00:02:03,420
Get up!

40
00:02:05,540 --> 00:02:06,700
You wicked woman.

41
00:02:06,850 --> 00:02:08,300
You competed with us in business,

42
00:02:08,330 --> 00:02:09,970
sold Fushou Cream behind our backs,

43
00:02:10,050 --> 00:02:11,650
and now you've hurt my brother.

44
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,329
I should've killed you long ago.

45
00:02:13,330 --> 00:02:13,859
Both of you,

46
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:14,810
calm down.

47
00:02:15,370 --> 00:02:16,529
We found

48
00:02:16,530 --> 00:02:17,209
the real culprit

49
00:02:17,210 --> 00:02:18,370
thanks to Yan Qiu.

50
00:02:18,490 --> 00:02:19,859
She's on our side now.

51
00:02:19,860 --> 00:02:21,060
- Our side?
- Our side?

52
00:02:22,220 --> 00:02:24,400
Today's operation with Xiao
is the most important one yet.

53
00:02:24,420 --> 00:02:26,299
We only pretended
to be badly injured and sick

54
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:27,049
so we could

55
00:02:27,050 --> 00:02:28,250
spring the trap tonight

56
00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:29,329
and wipe out the mastermind

57
00:02:29,330 --> 00:02:30,900
once and for all.

58
00:02:31,770 --> 00:02:32,369
But

59
00:02:32,370 --> 00:02:33,489
after everything she's done,

60
00:02:33,490 --> 00:02:35,180
how can you trust her?

61
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:38,410
There's an old saying.

62
00:02:39,070 --> 00:02:41,020
"It's never too late
to turn over a new leaf."

63
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:41,739
Since Yan Qiu

64
00:02:41,740 --> 00:02:43,340
chooses our side,

65
00:02:43,370 --> 00:02:44,370
from now on,

66
00:02:44,580 --> 00:02:45,850
she's our friend.

67
00:02:51,490 --> 00:02:52,500
You really

68
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:53,979
want to be friends

69
00:02:53,980 --> 00:02:55,210
with someone like me?

70
00:02:56,090 --> 00:02:57,340
Why wouldn't I?

71
00:02:57,580 --> 00:02:59,090
You're beautiful, smart,

72
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:01,020
and you've got good business sense.

73
00:03:01,140 --> 00:03:03,179
If you'd been born
a thousand years later,

74
00:03:03,180 --> 00:03:05,020
you'd be a top entrepreneur.

75
00:03:05,180 --> 00:03:06,529
You were forced onto the wrong path

76
00:03:06,530 --> 00:03:07,690
because you were threatened.

77
00:03:07,930 --> 00:03:09,020
Stay with us from now on.

78
00:03:09,260 --> 00:03:10,559
You'll not only live

79
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,930
a happy, carefree life,

80
00:03:12,490 --> 00:03:13,650
you'll also get to use

81
00:03:14,810 --> 00:03:16,060
your talents for good.

82
00:03:17,690 --> 00:03:18,859
Where I come from,

83
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:20,780
a fist bump
is the highest sign of friendship.

84
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:24,930
Don't worry.

85
00:03:25,420 --> 00:03:26,410
Now that we're friends,

86
00:03:26,610 --> 00:03:27,530
I promise

87
00:03:27,650 --> 00:03:29,180
I'll rescue your brother.

88
00:03:44,060 --> 00:03:45,830
(For all these years,)

89
00:03:46,070 --> 00:03:48,290
(I endured and bided my time)

90
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:50,930
(competing with Xiao Ce.)

91
00:03:51,420 --> 00:03:52,790
(Now,)

92
00:03:52,810 --> 00:03:55,410
(it has all paid off.)

93
00:04:00,700 --> 00:04:02,370
Why the sudden jolt?

94
00:04:02,810 --> 00:04:03,369
Someone...

95
00:04:03,370 --> 00:04:04,500
Someone's blocking the road.

96
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:06,690
Who dares stop my carriage?

97
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:19,820
You?

98
00:04:20,090 --> 00:04:21,020
Why are you here?

99
00:04:31,770 --> 00:04:33,020
Gu Bei and I only pretended

100
00:04:33,530 --> 00:04:35,610
to be gravely injured.

101
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:38,340
We wanted you to let your guard down

102
00:04:38,770 --> 00:04:40,340
and expose yourself.

103
00:04:40,620 --> 00:04:42,289
You thought the time was right

104
00:04:42,290 --> 00:04:43,530
and everything was under control.

105
00:04:44,170 --> 00:04:45,380
But we handed you

106
00:04:45,460 --> 00:04:46,940
that chance,

107
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:49,900
just to force you into action.

108
00:04:50,850 --> 00:04:51,580
Your Majesty,

109
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:52,700
it's Fushou Cream.

110
00:04:54,730 --> 00:04:55,940
Hu Wenyuan,

111
00:04:56,650 --> 00:04:58,460
you've risen to Grand Chancellor,

112
00:04:58,530 --> 00:04:59,780
with wealth and power.

113
00:05:00,140 --> 00:05:02,410
Why let greed consume you,

114
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:04,459
selling drugs that destroy

115
00:05:04,460 --> 00:05:05,780
our nation and its people?

116
00:05:07,820 --> 00:05:08,780
Your Majesty!

117
00:05:09,620 --> 00:05:10,380
Your Majesty!

118
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:12,340
Your Majesty,

119
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:14,900
Official Gu has searched
the Chancellor's residence. But...

120
00:05:15,820 --> 00:05:16,650
Speak.

121
00:05:19,490 --> 00:05:20,259
There was

122
00:05:20,260 --> 00:05:21,449
no great fortune inside.

123
00:05:21,450 --> 00:05:23,410
It looked like the home
of an honest official.

124
00:05:25,060 --> 00:05:26,020
No fortune?

125
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:29,769
The Fushou Cream brings

126
00:05:29,770 --> 00:05:30,780
enormous profits.

127
00:05:31,650 --> 00:05:33,220
You risked everything for it.

128
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,940
Where did

129
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:36,260
all that money go?

130
00:05:39,290 --> 00:05:41,090
You think I did all this

131
00:05:41,700 --> 00:05:43,290
just for money?

132
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,840
Xiao Ce,

133
00:05:45,170 --> 00:05:47,050
you're still too naive.

134
00:05:47,630 --> 00:05:49,050
Did it never occur to you

135
00:05:49,380 --> 00:05:50,619
what all that money

136
00:05:50,620 --> 00:05:52,340
was really for?

137
00:05:59,580 --> 00:06:01,780
Chancellor Hu has done well.

138
00:06:02,210 --> 00:06:02,819
He's

139
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:04,769
far better

140
00:06:04,770 --> 00:06:06,280
than that reckless Sun Beiming.

141
00:06:07,620 --> 00:06:09,089
I've prepared

142
00:06:09,090 --> 00:06:10,970
a wedding gift for you.

143
00:06:11,140 --> 00:06:13,090
Everything will go smoothly.

144
00:06:13,530 --> 00:06:14,380
I obey,

145
00:06:14,580 --> 00:06:15,610
Master.

146
00:06:19,290 --> 00:06:20,209
Master,

147
00:06:20,210 --> 00:06:22,000
Gu Bei has searched
the Chancellor's residence.

148
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,100
It's fine.

149
00:06:23,730 --> 00:06:24,610
Hu Wenyuan

150
00:06:24,650 --> 00:06:26,119
already sent the Fushou Cream

151
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:27,490
out of the capital.

152
00:06:27,510 --> 00:06:28,579
There won't be

153
00:06:28,580 --> 00:06:29,970
a shred of evidence left.

154
00:06:31,060 --> 00:06:32,230
Master! Bad news!

155
00:06:32,230 --> 00:06:34,500
His Majesty personally led
the Imperial Guards to arrest Chancellor Hu.

156
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:35,800
Our entire shipment

157
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:37,380
has been seized.

158
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:40,290
Well played, Xiao Ce.

159
00:06:40,330 --> 00:06:41,970
You faked your illness to deceive me.

160
00:06:42,530 --> 00:06:43,530
Xiao Ce.

161
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:44,800
Gu Bei.

162
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:47,340
You've taken down two of my best men

163
00:06:47,650 --> 00:06:48,970
and ruined my plans.

164
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:52,700
I won't let either of you off.

165
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:01,380
Don't worry so much.

166
00:07:01,910 --> 00:07:03,700
Have some calming tea.

167
00:07:04,290 --> 00:07:06,020
Gu Bei went with the Imperial Guards.

168
00:07:06,290 --> 00:07:08,050
They should be back soon.

169
00:07:08,290 --> 00:07:09,900
I wonder if my brother

170
00:07:10,210 --> 00:07:12,500
is still alive.

171
00:07:15,020 --> 00:07:15,820
Gu Bei.

172
00:07:27,950 --> 00:07:28,940
As expected.

173
00:07:32,130 --> 00:07:33,930
Qiu!

174
00:07:40,650 --> 00:07:42,210
Qiu!

175
00:07:47,650 --> 00:07:48,850
I'm so sorry.

176
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:52,560
It's my fault.

177
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:54,700
I failed to protect you.

178
00:07:58,380 --> 00:08:00,490
I failed to protect you.

179
00:08:02,810 --> 00:08:04,990
I'm so touched.

180
00:08:06,330 --> 00:08:07,020
Yan Qiu,

181
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:08,059
I kept

182
00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:08,900
my promise.

183
00:08:24,330 --> 00:08:25,820
Since my parents passed away,

184
00:08:26,940 --> 00:08:28,089
no one has ever

185
00:08:28,090 --> 00:08:29,580
treated me with such sincerity.

186
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:31,460
Thank you.

187
00:08:32,260 --> 00:08:33,010
Gu Bei.

188
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:41,400
(Xiaoyao Pavilion)

189
00:08:42,020 --> 00:08:43,250
Thank you, everyone.

190
00:08:44,220 --> 00:08:45,139
Don't mention it.

191
00:08:45,140 --> 00:08:46,130
Gu Bei said

192
00:08:46,170 --> 00:08:47,449
that as long as you're here,

193
00:08:47,450 --> 00:08:48,660
we're family.

194
00:08:49,290 --> 00:08:50,979
Now that you're reunited
with your brother,

195
00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:52,700
no one can force you
to do anything again.

196
00:08:52,980 --> 00:08:54,069
That's right.

197
00:08:54,070 --> 00:08:55,449
With your business talent,

198
00:08:55,450 --> 00:08:57,870
Xiaoyao Pavilion will make a fortune.

199
00:08:57,970 --> 00:08:59,050
Thank you all.

200
00:09:00,290 --> 00:09:01,300
And thank you too.

201
00:09:02,650 --> 00:09:03,340
You're welcome.

202
00:09:08,020 --> 00:09:08,809
There's one thing

203
00:09:08,810 --> 00:09:10,010
I can't figure out.

204
00:09:10,410 --> 00:09:12,220
Hu Wenyuan
sold the Fushou Cream for years.

205
00:09:12,310 --> 00:09:14,040
He should've amassed
an enormous fortune.

206
00:09:14,930 --> 00:09:16,890
Yet his residence was bare.

207
00:09:17,050 --> 00:09:19,090
Where did

208
00:09:19,290 --> 00:09:20,770
all that drug money go?

209
00:09:29,420 --> 00:09:31,259
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

210
00:09:31,260 --> 00:09:33,659
♪Our spirit soars to the skies♪

211
00:09:33,660 --> 00:09:39,099
♪The brainy emperor plots the strategy♪

212
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:43,459
♪The slacker general leads the charge♪

213
00:09:43,460 --> 00:09:45,859
♪Swords clash and warhorses thunder♪

214
00:09:45,860 --> 00:09:48,419
♪Let the history judge our deeds♪

215
00:09:48,420 --> 00:09:54,099
♪Our brotherhood is priceless♪

216
00:09:54,100 --> 00:09:59,660
♪Peace across the land, carefree at last♪

217
00:10:03,940 --> 00:10:05,980
♪Funny moments never stop♪

218
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:08,820
♪Silly blunders never cease♪

219
00:10:09,020 --> 00:10:13,179
♪Yet through every up and down♪

220
00:10:13,180 --> 00:10:15,140
♪We create miracles♪

221
00:10:15,460 --> 00:10:17,900
♪From naive youths♪

222
00:10:18,180 --> 00:10:20,659
♪To legendary heroes♪

223
00:10:20,660 --> 00:10:22,579
♪This journey♪

224
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:26,619
♪Is one we'll be proud of♪

225
00:10:26,620 --> 00:10:29,140
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

226
00:10:31,620 --> 00:10:34,500
♪Let's create♪

227
00:10:36,540 --> 00:10:44,460
♪A legend of our own♪
